@startuml
title bloc_bridge - from message to reply
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Receive a Telegram text message;
:Check the chat allowlist;
note right
  Unauthorized messages are ignored.
end note
:Send an acknowledgement;
:Queue the request;
note right
  If capacity is reached, ask the user
  to retry later instead of queuing.
end note

if (Slash command?) then (yes)
  :Handle the command\nwithout calling the model;
else (no)
  :Reuse or create this chat's\nOpenCode session;
  :Submit the prompt to OpenCode\nand wait for its response;
endif

:Format the reply and update\nthe Telegram acknowledgement;
stop
@enduml
